WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.731
In this tour, you'll see how B1 Check In
works on a Sunday morning.

2
00:00:03.731 --> 00:00:07.017
B1 Check In is the app families use to
check in their kids.

3
00:00:07.017 --> 00:00:09.245
It runs on an iPad or an Android tablet,

4
00:00:09.245 --> 00:00:11.695
and it can print name tags and pickup
slips.

5
00:00:11.695 --> 00:00:14.257
You sign in once with your ChurchApps
account.

6
00:00:15.067 --> 00:00:18.039
Then choose your church. After that, the
tablet remembers it.

7
00:00:18.839 --> 00:00:21.052
Next, tap the service you're checking in
for.

8
00:00:21.052 --> 00:00:23.855
This list comes from the services you set
up in B1 Admin.

9
00:00:24.655 --> 00:00:26.414
Now the kiosk is ready for families.

10
00:00:26.414 --> 00:00:30.274
A parent looks up their family with the
last four digits of their phone number.

11
00:00:31.088 --> 00:00:33.689
Or they can tap Search by name, and type
their last name.

12
00:00:34.489 --> 00:00:36.347
Type the four digits, and tap Search.

13
00:00:37.156 --> 00:00:38.967
Tap your name to load your household.

14
00:00:39.767 --> 00:00:41.491
Everyone in the family is listed.

15
00:00:41.491 --> 00:00:43.111
Tap a child to open their card.

16
00:00:43.911 --> 00:00:46.902
You'll see each service time, and the
groups offered at that time.

17
00:00:46.902 --> 00:00:47.673
Tap Select Group.

18
00:00:48.478 --> 00:00:50.278
Groups are sorted by category.

19
00:00:50.278 --> 00:00:53.039
If you set age or grade ranges on your
groups,

20
00:00:53.039 --> 00:00:56.039
the rooms that fit this child are marked
Eligible,

21
00:00:56.039 --> 00:00:59.159
and the others say Outside age range. Tap
Preschool.

22
00:00:59.959 --> 00:01:02.420
Do the same for each child. Ruby goes to
the Nursery.

23
00:01:03.226 --> 00:01:06.198
Adults who are just going to worship can
be left without a group.

24
00:01:06.998 --> 00:01:09.320
Visiting friends or relatives? Tap Add a
Guest.

25
00:01:10.131 --> 00:01:12.174
Just a first and last name, and tap Add
Guest.

26
00:01:12.974 --> 00:01:14.971
When everyone is ready, tap Check In.

27
00:01:15.774 --> 00:01:17.426
Attendance is recorded in B1.

28
00:01:17.426 --> 00:01:21.185
If a label printer is connected, a name
tag prints for each child,

29
00:01:21.185 --> 00:01:24.830
plus a pickup slip for the parent with a
matching security code.

30
00:01:25.641 --> 00:01:28.335
Then the kiosk goes back to the start for
the next family.

31
00:01:28.335 --> 00:01:30.471
First time visitors can tap Register as
guest.

32
00:01:31.274 --> 00:01:34.412
They scan this code with their phone and
fill in their own details.

33
00:01:34.412 --> 00:01:36.800
Or they can tap Register here, right on
the tablet.

34
00:01:37.607 --> 00:01:41.136
Staff can tap the church logo seven times
to open Admin Settings.

35
00:01:41.940 --> 00:01:46.075
Here you can change the service, choose a
printer, or set an admin PIN.

36
00:01:46.075 --> 00:01:49.627
Turn on Manned station mode for a station
run by a volunteer.

37
00:01:49.627 --> 00:01:52.946
It adds check out, paging parents, and
reprinting labels.

38
00:01:53.746 --> 00:01:56.532
Back on the kiosk, there's now a Check out
button. Tap it.

39
00:01:57.346 --> 00:02:00.040
Type the security code from the parent's
pickup slip.

40
00:02:00.846 --> 00:02:02.842
B1 shows the children who are going home.

41
00:02:02.842 --> 00:02:05.908
Tap the person who is picking them up, and
they're checked out.

42
00:02:06.713 --> 00:02:09.404
Here's a tip. The full phone number works
too,

43
00:02:09.404 --> 00:02:13.031
which helps when two families share the
same last four digits.

44
00:02:13.031 --> 00:02:16.951
Next, watch Setting Up Children's Check In
to get your rooms ready.

45
00:02:16.951 --> 00:02:20.227
And for step by step help, visit
support.churchapps.org.
